WEBVTT

00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:10.275
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:21.285
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.865 --> 00:00:30.765
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:37.225
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:39.275
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:43.565
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.315 --> 00:00:48.445
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.855 --> 00:00:52.655
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.325 --> 00:01:00.325
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.665 --> 00:01:09.005
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:16.005
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.215 --> 00:01:21.485
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.585 --> 00:01:24.645
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:36.405 --> 00:01:40.665
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:44.565
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:44.675 --> 00:01:47.265
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:50.885 --> 00:01:53.375
Acquiring two Rune-Gods,
Hikaru and company...

00:01:53.485 --> 00:01:57.015
...continued their journey for
the last remaining Rune-God.

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:03.025
Along the way, the girls were
attacked by Swordmaster Lafarga.

00:02:04.025 --> 00:02:08.585
However, he was actually the captain
of Princess Emeraude's guards.

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:12.535
Lafarga, who was controlled
by High Priest Zagato...

00:02:12.635 --> 00:02:16.735
...regained his memory
by fighting Hikaru and company...

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:20.745
...and in the end became
a powerful ally to the three girls.

00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:26.815
The Truth About Inouva
and the Return of Memories

00:02:49.745 --> 00:02:51.075
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:02:51.175 --> 00:02:52.265
Ms. Hikaru?

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.675
It doesn't even get sunny anymore...

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:59.845
When we were summoned to Cephiro,
there was a beautiful, blue sky...

00:02:59.955 --> 00:03:01.385
That is true...

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.935
The ground split!

00:03:21.035 --> 00:03:23.805
This world is really
starting to fall apart.

00:03:29.815 --> 00:03:31.905
The jewel on Mokona's forehead!

00:03:39.655 --> 00:03:40.625
Clef!

00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:43.145
I'm glad to see you again!

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:47.595
We were worried because we
have not heard from you in a while.

00:03:50.135 --> 00:03:51.325
Clef?

00:03:51.805 --> 00:03:53.565
What is the matter?

00:03:54.005 --> 00:03:56.095
Girls from another world...

00:03:57.105 --> 00:04:00.945
I believe that this will be the
last time I communicate with you.

00:04:01.545 --> 00:04:02.945
Clef...

00:04:03.045 --> 00:04:08.005
I have reached my limits in
suppressing Zagato's stone spell.

00:04:08.385 --> 00:04:10.355
Clef, hang on!

00:04:11.225 --> 00:04:13.485
The time of collapse is approaching.

00:04:13.595 --> 00:04:16.325
Hurry. Before it is too late.

00:04:16.865 --> 00:04:18.455
Sea God Selece.

00:04:19.265 --> 00:04:20.855
Wind God Windam.

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.465
You have triumphed
over hardships...

00:04:24.565 --> 00:04:27.665
...and successfully
revived two Rune-Gods.

00:04:28.475 --> 00:04:30.705
Only the last Rune-God remains.

00:04:31.175 --> 00:04:33.235
The last Rune-God...

00:04:33.775 --> 00:04:34.805
Hurry.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:40.315
At this rate, if you are unable
to grant Princess Emeraude's wish...

00:04:40.415 --> 00:04:43.645
...you will collapse with
Cephiro and face eradication.

00:04:44.055 --> 00:04:45.145
Collapse?

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:46.755
Eradication?

00:04:46.855 --> 00:04:51.315
Yes. You will never
be able to return to your world.

00:04:53.235 --> 00:04:55.755
Hurry, girls from another world!

00:04:57.335 --> 00:05:01.235
Follow Mokona and
revive the last Rune-God.

00:05:02.275 --> 00:05:06.205
And become Magic Knights,
and with the three Rune-Gods...

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:07.245
Clef!

00:05:07.315 --> 00:05:08.535
He's disappearing!

00:05:08.645 --> 00:05:11.405
Also, girls from another world...

00:05:11.915 --> 00:05:13.905
Your true enemy is...

00:05:14.915 --> 00:05:15.905
Clef!

00:05:18.355 --> 00:05:22.415
This world that we might
be able to save if we do our best...

00:05:22.525 --> 00:05:23.615
Cephiro...

00:05:26.895 --> 00:05:30.235
Umi, Fuu, let's go. There's no time.

00:05:30.335 --> 00:05:31.425
Right.

00:05:38.475 --> 00:05:40.845
Zagato, please stop...

00:05:40.945 --> 00:05:45.145
At this rate, it will be irrecoverable...

00:05:47.115 --> 00:05:48.205
Zagato!

00:06:12.675 --> 00:06:13.645
My lord.

00:06:17.745 --> 00:06:20.685
The princess...
How is Princess Emeraude?

00:06:21.185 --> 00:06:22.445
The same.

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:28.155
Her tears have not dried a single
moment since I began this battle.

00:06:29.825 --> 00:06:32.925
Alcyone, Ascot,
Caldina, and Lafarga...

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:35.625
None were able
to defeat the Magic Knights.

00:06:37.335 --> 00:06:39.265
And neither could I...

00:06:44.075 --> 00:06:45.765
T-This can't be...

00:06:45.875 --> 00:06:47.305
Impossible...

00:06:58.585 --> 00:07:00.685
This is the Rune-God?

00:07:00.995 --> 00:07:02.455
This power is...

00:07:12.065 --> 00:07:14.765
My lord,
please grant me permission...

00:07:14.875 --> 00:07:18.325
...to go after
the Magic Knights one last time.

00:07:18.945 --> 00:07:23.005
Those girls from another world
defeated me in this form...

00:07:23.115 --> 00:07:27.375
...but if I revert to my original form,
I can use all of my powers.

00:07:27.485 --> 00:07:28.815
My lord!

00:07:29.455 --> 00:07:32.615
Please, listen to my wish.

00:07:34.355 --> 00:07:35.515
My lord!

00:07:35.625 --> 00:07:38.425
I know you have
kept me at your side...

00:07:38.525 --> 00:07:42.795
...because I was a creature Princess
Emeraude presented you as a gift!

00:07:44.605 --> 00:07:48.795
Please revert me to the form
I possessed prior to this battle...

00:07:48.905 --> 00:07:51.335
...when I was always at your side!

00:07:51.975 --> 00:07:54.535
Inouva, you are a creature...

00:07:54.645 --> 00:07:57.735
...an elemental with
the highest magical powers.

00:07:58.085 --> 00:08:03.105
That is why I was able to turn you
into a human as you wished.

00:08:04.155 --> 00:08:07.025
I had once wished to take this form.

00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:11.385
I know it is selfish of me
to ask to be reverted.

00:08:11.925 --> 00:08:14.365
When I first asked to be changed...

00:08:14.465 --> 00:08:19.095
...I told you this human form
would allow me to wield a sword...

00:08:19.205 --> 00:08:23.465
...and watch over those we
gathered to defeat the Magic Knights.

00:08:23.905 --> 00:08:24.995
However...

00:08:27.245 --> 00:08:32.185
To defeat matured Magic Knights
who have revived two Rune-Gods...

00:08:32.715 --> 00:08:36.945
...the only solution is to use
every bit of magic power I have!

00:08:37.055 --> 00:08:38.355
Inouva...

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:42.555
Please grant me one
more chance to repay you...

00:08:42.655 --> 00:08:46.925
...for keeping me at your side just
because I was a gift from the princess!

00:08:47.035 --> 00:08:51.625
If you revert to that form, you can
never again take human shape.

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:54.965
I understand that.

00:08:55.705 --> 00:08:58.335
Why are you so devoted to me?

00:08:59.075 --> 00:09:02.805
I have seen you beside
the princess all this time, my lord.

00:09:03.585 --> 00:09:06.275
I have seen all of
your feelings as well.

00:09:07.115 --> 00:09:09.385
Cephiro is a world of will.

00:09:09.485 --> 00:09:11.885
A world where the heart wins over all.

00:09:11.985 --> 00:09:15.255
There is no way that
your wish will not come true.

00:09:16.965 --> 00:09:21.955
Even if it is an evil wish that
uproots every rule in Cephiro...

00:09:22.065 --> 00:09:22.995
No.

00:09:23.905 --> 00:09:26.765
No matter who brands you as evil...

00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:30.465
...to me, your wish
means the world, my lord.

00:09:31.345 --> 00:09:32.965
Very well, Inouva.

00:10:11.985 --> 00:10:13.075
Inouva...

00:10:45.785 --> 00:10:46.385
Let's go!

00:10:46.385 --> 00:10:47.615
Let's go!
Yeah. Yes.

00:10:57.795 --> 00:10:58.785
What?

00:11:20.215 --> 00:11:21.645
What is that?

00:11:29.425 --> 00:11:30.585
A beast?

00:12:13.735 --> 00:12:16.935
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:18.675 --> 00:12:21.905
That beast is trying to kill us.

00:12:24.345 --> 00:12:26.815
Girls from another world...

00:12:27.785 --> 00:12:29.945
What? A voice in my head...

00:12:30.055 --> 00:12:31.785
Yes, a voice...

00:12:32.355 --> 00:12:34.255
It's that white beast's voice!

00:12:35.055 --> 00:12:40.225
Girls from another world,
I cannot let you go any further.

00:12:41.135 --> 00:12:42.725
Who are you?

00:13:02.985 --> 00:13:06.255
Cephiro's skies used
to be so beautiful, but now...

00:13:06.925 --> 00:13:08.755
Hikaru... Umi...

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:12.725
Fuu.

00:13:13.425 --> 00:13:16.365
I wonder if their
journey is going safely.

00:13:18.035 --> 00:13:22.475
Please protect the three girls that
you summoned from another world...

00:13:23.075 --> 00:13:24.665
...Princess Emeraude.

00:13:28.445 --> 00:13:32.245
That is something
that I gave to him as a gift.

00:13:32.645 --> 00:13:34.585
It was not stolen.

00:13:36.755 --> 00:13:37.985
Ferio...

00:13:41.795 --> 00:13:42.915
Ferio...

00:13:44.595 --> 00:13:45.955
What was that?

00:13:46.995 --> 00:13:49.825
Back when I snuck into the castle...

00:13:51.665 --> 00:13:53.865
...and got this orb from her.

00:13:54.735 --> 00:13:55.935
Ferio...

00:13:57.905 --> 00:14:02.345
How did Princess Emeraude
know my name? We'd never met...

00:14:03.175 --> 00:14:04.275
Ferio!

00:14:06.385 --> 00:14:09.145
A child? Who is that child?

00:14:10.655 --> 00:14:12.785
Why is she calling my name?

00:14:21.135 --> 00:14:23.185
It is I, Magic Knights.

00:14:27.275 --> 00:14:28.235
Who...

00:14:31.805 --> 00:14:33.775
You still don't understand?

00:14:33.875 --> 00:14:36.675
The last time we met
was at the Sky Shrine.

00:14:38.085 --> 00:14:39.545
That voice...

00:14:40.385 --> 00:14:41.945
The Sky Shrine?

00:14:42.355 --> 00:14:44.585
You are the one from when...

00:14:44.955 --> 00:14:46.785
My name is Inouva.

00:14:46.885 --> 00:14:51.485
I stand here with an order from
Lord Zagato to kill the Magic Knights.

00:14:52.625 --> 00:14:56.185
This is my true form, Magic Knights.

00:14:57.805 --> 00:15:01.395
And now that I am
back in my true form...

00:15:02.235 --> 00:15:03.895
...you cannot win!

00:15:08.215 --> 00:15:09.405
Ferio!

00:15:10.885 --> 00:15:11.815
I...

00:15:12.445 --> 00:15:14.045
Since I was born...

00:15:14.155 --> 00:15:17.585
...I've never had parents
or siblings and lived all alone.

00:15:18.055 --> 00:15:19.185
Siblings?

00:15:19.885 --> 00:15:22.385
Sister!

00:15:23.455 --> 00:15:24.515
Sister!

00:15:26.495 --> 00:15:27.425
Ferio...

00:15:29.195 --> 00:15:31.995
I will never see you again...

00:15:33.265 --> 00:15:36.465
...my only dear little brother.

00:15:37.845 --> 00:15:39.395
That can't be!

00:15:40.075 --> 00:15:43.775
I'm Princess
Emeraude's little brother?

00:15:52.085 --> 00:15:55.485
Sister, I have one wish
before we part ways.

00:15:56.725 --> 00:15:57.925
A wish?

00:15:58.395 --> 00:16:01.365
Yes. I want you to erase my memory.

00:16:02.365 --> 00:16:05.565
The Pillar has the important
task of supporting this world.

00:16:06.035 --> 00:16:09.335
It is better to have fewer
problems to worry about.

00:16:10.505 --> 00:16:15.605
If I can never see you again, I will
live alone so I will not trouble you.

00:16:16.445 --> 00:16:20.885
So please, you should also
forget that you ever had a brother.

00:16:22.255 --> 00:16:23.515
That's right...

00:16:24.055 --> 00:16:27.645
I received this orb
from you when I left the castle.

00:16:29.195 --> 00:16:35.685
Even if I erase your memory,
I do not think I can forget you.

00:16:36.235 --> 00:16:38.325
Take these orbs.

00:16:38.805 --> 00:16:42.065
So that I can hear
your voice from far away.

00:16:42.605 --> 00:16:48.045
So that I will never forget
the voice of my only dear brother.

00:16:49.715 --> 00:16:51.005
I see...

00:16:51.745 --> 00:16:54.685
That's why I was
so worried about you.

00:16:55.385 --> 00:16:59.515
When I found out Cephiro was
in ruins and you were in danger...

00:16:59.625 --> 00:17:01.645
The reason I couldn't stand still...

00:17:02.325 --> 00:17:05.415
...was because you were
my one and only sister!

00:17:08.595 --> 00:17:09.695
Fuu!

00:17:10.165 --> 00:17:12.325
Water...

00:17:17.505 --> 00:17:18.995
...Dragon!

00:17:24.745 --> 00:17:27.405
Magic... doesn't work?

00:17:27.985 --> 00:17:29.145
Ferio...

00:17:29.815 --> 00:17:33.255
I see your memory
has come back to you.

00:17:33.355 --> 00:17:36.125
Sister! Sister, is that you?

00:17:37.125 --> 00:17:40.355
Are you willing to call me
your sister once again?

00:17:42.465 --> 00:17:46.095
All the memories that
I erased have returned...

00:17:47.475 --> 00:17:49.335
...because my powers are waning...

00:17:49.435 --> 00:17:52.205
...and the seal on your
memory has been released.

00:17:53.245 --> 00:17:54.335
Can't I...

00:17:55.015 --> 00:17:57.175
...help you, Sister?

00:18:00.015 --> 00:18:03.345
Only those from
another world can do this.

00:18:06.585 --> 00:18:10.685
They are currently facing
a life-threatening danger.

00:18:14.265 --> 00:18:16.525
Ferio, please...

00:18:16.635 --> 00:18:18.605
Please lend them your strength!

00:18:19.665 --> 00:18:21.635
Save the Magic Knights!

00:18:24.575 --> 00:18:27.005
Umi, is Fuu all right?

00:18:27.745 --> 00:18:29.175
Hang on, Fuu!

00:18:30.945 --> 00:18:32.975
I am all right.

00:18:33.815 --> 00:18:37.945
More importantly, we must
do something about that enemy...

00:18:39.125 --> 00:18:43.425
I'm sure he'll try to finish
us off with his next attack.

00:18:47.665 --> 00:18:50.965
I congratulate you
for surviving this long.

00:18:52.135 --> 00:18:54.695
But this is it.

00:18:55.605 --> 00:18:57.865
Hikaru! Umi! Fuu!

00:18:57.975 --> 00:18:59.905
Can you hear me?

00:19:00.005 --> 00:19:01.205
Ferio!

00:19:02.215 --> 00:19:04.775
Ferio, you're all right...

00:19:05.115 --> 00:19:08.205
Don't worry about me!
Listen to me closely!

00:19:09.355 --> 00:19:12.415
The weakness of Inouva,
the creature you're fighting...

00:19:12.525 --> 00:19:15.885
...is the gem
on his forehead! Attack that gem!

00:19:16.455 --> 00:19:20.365
It's useless. Swords and magic
haven't worked on him.

00:19:21.235 --> 00:19:22.325
Umi...

00:19:22.765 --> 00:19:24.325
Take care of Fuu.

00:19:25.235 --> 00:19:28.495
Are you going in
by yourself? That's crazy!

00:19:28.605 --> 00:19:31.475
We promised a lot of people...

00:19:32.275 --> 00:19:35.505
...that we'd become
Magic Knights and save Cephiro.

00:19:36.975 --> 00:19:39.975
So let's do our best, Umi, Fuu.

00:19:40.215 --> 00:19:42.375
Die, Magic Knights!

00:20:01.175 --> 00:20:03.435
Lord Zagato...

00:20:04.145 --> 00:20:05.405
Inouva...

00:20:06.005 --> 00:20:07.375
Inouva...

00:20:23.895 --> 00:20:26.055
Good, you came to.

00:20:26.965 --> 00:20:28.125
Ferio!

00:20:28.235 --> 00:20:29.395
Umi!

00:20:29.495 --> 00:20:30.895
And Fuu too!

00:20:31.005 --> 00:20:33.235
Yeah, we're all right.

00:20:33.465 --> 00:20:36.905
We were able
to defeat that beast, Inouva.

00:20:37.575 --> 00:20:38.695
Ferio...

00:20:39.375 --> 00:20:41.505
It was thanks to you.

00:20:44.815 --> 00:20:48.975
No, Princess Emeraude was
the one who told me his weakness.

00:20:49.085 --> 00:20:50.955
Princess Emeraude?

00:20:51.055 --> 00:20:53.455
This is your orb, Ferio...

00:20:56.195 --> 00:20:59.625
Princess Emeraude's powers
have severely weakened.

00:21:00.095 --> 00:21:04.625
She can only communicate
with you through this magic item.

00:21:05.365 --> 00:21:08.925
So this is meant for you to have.

00:21:09.875 --> 00:21:12.395
Ferio, what's wrong?

00:21:18.545 --> 00:21:23.315
Only the Magic Knights from another
world can save Princess Emeraude.

00:21:23.955 --> 00:21:26.545
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu...

00:21:27.025 --> 00:21:28.955
Please, save the princess...

00:21:30.255 --> 00:21:32.285
...and please save Cephiro!

00:21:32.825 --> 00:21:34.025
Ferio...

00:21:43.935 --> 00:21:48.965
Lord Zagato, I have returned with
a plan to defeat the Magic Knights.

00:21:49.545 --> 00:21:52.815
Please grant me,
Alcyone, one last chance...

00:21:59.425 --> 00:22:00.655
Please wait!

00:22:02.255 --> 00:22:03.485
Please...

00:22:03.595 --> 00:22:05.255
Lord Zagato!

00:22:07.535 --> 00:22:09.895
Lord Zagato!

00:22:26.085 --> 00:22:30.485
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.055 --> 00:22:37.655
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.095 --> 00:22:44.655
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.405 --> 00:22:49.235
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.545 --> 00:22:54.705
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.915 --> 00:22:57.345
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.445 --> 00:23:02.245
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.285 --> 00:23:09.915
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.655 --> 00:23:15.925
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.295 --> 00:23:23.105
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.605 --> 00:23:29.045
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:45.465 --> 00:23:47.555
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!

00:23:47.665 --> 00:23:52.255
We finally reached the cave where
the last Rune-God, Rayearth, rests.

00:23:52.365 --> 00:23:55.305
Hikaru entered the Fire Shrine.

00:23:56.005 --> 00:23:58.405
Right then,
Zagato suddenly appeared...

00:23:58.505 --> 00:24:00.945
...and took away
my armor and Fuu's!

00:24:01.045 --> 00:24:03.805
How are we supposed to fight?

00:24:04.115 --> 00:24:06.015
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.085 --> 00:24:08.605
The Last Rune-God:
Rayearth, Lord of Fire.

00:24:08.715 --> 00:24:09.155
The Last Rune-God:
Rayearth, Lord of Fire

